{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1223a81daad6934c","name":"R-28 Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-1223a81daad6934c","title":"R-28 Starfighter","revision":20282,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:33:35Z","sha256":"d954b883ce9439b6d255c860cd22cbac0e7a87c71d0fa3203ed02d8dc654cab4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20282","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=R-28%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1223a81daad6934c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of the oldest Starfighter models still in production, the R-28 Starfighter is the latest iteration of a Starship design that dates all the way back to the Galactic Civil War. The first prototypes upon which the R-28 is based were designed before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},", but production of the R-28 never got fully underway thanks to the runaway success of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-Wing Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-Wing_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:3633fb1b1140ece1"},". However, once ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," is established, engineers at Incom return to their original designs for the R-28 and begin incorporating modern technologies and engineering innovations. The result, the actual production model of the R-28, is an important intermediate step between the ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-Wing Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-Wing_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:3633fb1b1140ece1"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-83 TwinTail Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-83_TwinTail_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:93511fff441a96d8"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though considered outdated by most military and paramilitary forces by the time of Darth Krayt's rise to power, the R-28 Starfighter is one of the most common ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," found in the galaxy. With the return of the Empire, the Incom Corporation is forced to scale back its production of combat-capable Starfighter models, but where production of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-83 TwinTail Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-83_TwinTail_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:93511fff441a96d8"}," is almost completely shut down, the manufacture of the R-28 slows to a much reduced, but steady, pace. Though not enough to blunt the significant financial losses that Incom sustains during the rise of Darth Krayt's Empire, sales of the R-28 bring in a constant stream of revenue that keeps the company in business.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The stock R-28 model is relatively well armed for a ship of its size. Though the weapons load on the R-28 borders on being too heavy for Imperial regulations, the fact that half of the ship's weaponry consists of nonlethal munitions (specifically, the Fire-Linked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Cannons"},") allows the ship to pass inspection. Certainly compared to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["TwinTail Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TwinTail_Starfighter?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the R-28 is less destructive and less of a threat to Imperial forces. Additionally, since many of the parts used in the R-28 are also used in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["TwinTail Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TwinTail_Starfighter?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the Incom Corporation is able to use the continued production of the R-28 Starfighter to secretly manufacture the more powerful Starfighter.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["A'Sharad Hett"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A%27Sharad_Hett?action=edit&redlink=1"}," owned an early prototype R-28 Starfighter, which he crashed before being captured by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["R-28 Starfighter Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 28; +8 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 150; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 